ith an ivermectin slow-release bolus</article-title><source>Vet Parasitol</source><year>1993</year><volume>48</volume><fpage>215</fpage><lpage>227</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">8346635</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1016/0304-4017(93)90157-I</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B7"><citation citation-type="book"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Campbell</surname><given-names>WC</given-names></name></person-group><source>Ivermectin and abamectin</source><year>1989</year><publisher-name>Springer, New York</publisher-name><comment>ISBN 0-387-96944-6 (New York)</comment></citation></ref><ref id="B8"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Dickinson</surname><given-names>CH</given-names></name><name><surname>Underhay</surname><given-names>VSH</given-names></name><name><surname>Ross</surname><given-names>V</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Effect of season, soil fauna and water content on the decomposition of cattle dung pats</article-title><source>New Phytol</source><year>1981</year><volume>88</volume><fpage>129</fpage><lpage>141</lpage></citation></ref><ref id="B9"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Dimander</surname><given-names>S-O</given-names></name><name><surname>H&#x000f6;glund</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Uggla</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Sp&#x000f6;rndly</surname><given-names>E</given-names></name><name><surname>Waller</surname><given-names>PJ</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Evaluation of gastrointestinal nematode parasite control strategies for first-season grazing cattle in Sweden</article-title><source>Vet Parasitol</source><year>2003</year><volume>111</volume><fpage>193</fpage><lpage>209</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">12531294</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1016/S0304-4017(02)00380-1</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B10"><